msgid ""
"I also set up the explanation for the implementation of the coordination for"
" [two groups](ImplementationTwoGroups) and the [pair](ImplementationPair) "
"version"
msgstr ""
"[2 Group](ImplementationTwoGroups) と [Pair](ImplementationPair) の "
"Coordination の説明もあります。"
